        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9030, Beaded Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe beading detail on this appliance pull grants it a quite elegance. The Traditional Beaded Appliance Pull is available in 6 finishes including polished chrome, polished brass, and satin nickel. Choose from either a 12 inch c.c. or an 18 inch c.c. for appliance doors and large cabinet doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/beaded-cabinet-pull-omnia-9030\"><b>Beaded Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Beaded Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9030/305</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>AP-9030/458</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-17/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed this in a smaller size? <a href=\"/products/beaded-cabinet-pull-omnia-9030\"><b>click here</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lion-head-door-stop.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
